#==============================================================================================
#
#   border_radii_data - corner radii in CSS and device pixels
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Painting/BorderRadiiData.h (lines 1-161) and
#       BorderRadiiData.cpp (lines 1-54): CornerRadius and CornerRadii (device pixels, with
#       the point-in-rounded-rect test and the box-shadow spread adjustment), BorderRadiusData
#       and BorderRadiiData (CSS pixels). The conversions to device pixels (`as_corner`,
#       `as_corners`) read a DevicePixelConverter and stay in the engine (DESIGN.md §4.1.3).
